#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:107
msgid "![Wait for the install to complete](images/step5.png)"
msgstr "![等待安装完成](images/step5.png)"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:109
msgid "Once finished, you can continue on to installing Rust."
msgstr "完成后，您可以继续安装 Rust。"

#: src/index.md:1
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "引言"

#: src/index.md:3
msgid ""
"_rustup_ installs [The Rust Programming Language](https://www.rust-lang.org) "
"from the official release channels, enabling you to easily switch between "
"stable, beta, and nightly compilers and keep them updated. It makes cross-"
"compiling simpler with binary builds of the standard library for common "
"platforms. And it runs on all platforms Rust supports."
msgstr ""
"_rustup_installs [Rust Programming Language](https://www.rust-lang.org) 使您"
"能够轻松地在稳定、贝塔和夜间编译器之间切换并随时更新。 它使交叉编译更加简单，"
"使用普通平台标准库的二进制构建。它运行在所有平台上。Rust 支持。"

#: src/index.md:9
msgid ""
"Check out the [Concepts](concepts/index.md) chapter for an overview of how "
"rustup works and some of the terminology it uses. The [Installation]"
"(installation/index.md) chapter covers installing rustup and getting started."
msgstr ""
"查看 [Concepts](concepts/index.md章，以了解生死是如何工作的，以及它使用的一些"
"术语。 [Installation](installation/index.md章涉及安装程序和启动程序。"

#: src/index.md:13
msgid ""
"The source code of rustup and this manual may be found at <https://github."
"com/rust-lang/rustup>. If you find a problem, check out the [issue tracker]"
"(https://github.com/rust-lang/rustup/issues)."
msgstr ""
"Rustup 及其使用手册的源代码可以在以下地址找到：<https://github.com/rust-lang/"
"rustup>。如果您发现任何问题，请访问[问题跟踪系统](https://github.com/rust-"
"lang/rustup/issues)。"

#: src/index.md:17
msgid ""
"Release notes for rustup may be found in the [CHANGELOG](https://github.com/"
"rust-lang/rustup/blob/HEAD/CHANGELOG.md)."
msgstr ""
"Rustup的发布说明可以在[CHANGELOG](https://github.com/rust-lang/rustup/blob/"
"HEAD/CHANGELOG.md)中找到。"

#: src/network-proxies.md:1
msgid "Network proxies"
msgstr "网络代理"

#: src/network-proxies.md:3
msgid ""
"Enterprise networks often don't have direct outside HTTP access, but enforce "
"the use of proxies. If you're on such a network, you can request that "
"`rustup` uses a proxy by setting its URL in the environment. In most cases, "
"setting `https_proxy` should be sufficient. Commands may differ between "
"different systems and shells:"
msgstr ""
"企业网络通常没有直接对外 HTTP 访问权限，而是强制使用代理服务器。如果你处于这"
"样的网络中，可以通过在环境中设置`rustup`的 URL 来要求其使用代理服务器。在大多"
"数情况下，设置`https_proxy`参数应该就足够了。不同系统和 shell 下的命令可能会"
"有所不同。"

#: src/network-proxies.md:9
msgid "On a Unix-like system with a shell like **bash** or **zsh**:"
msgstr "在支持**bash**或**zsh**等 shell 脚本语言的 Unix 类系统中："

#: src/network-proxies.md:11 src/network-proxies.md:15
msgid "socks5://proxy.example.com:1080"
msgstr "socks5://proxy.example.com:1080"

#: src/network-proxies.md:13
msgid ""
"On Windows [**Command Prompt (cmd)**](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cmd.exe):"
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 系统中，[**命令提示符（cmd）**](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cmd."
"exe):"

#: src/network-proxies.md:17
msgid ""
"On Windows [**PowerShell**](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PowerShell) (or "
"**PowerShell Core**):"
msgstr ""
"在 Windows [**PowerShell**](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PowerShell(或"
"**Powershell Core**):在 Windows 操作系统上，可以使用 [**PowerShell**]"
"(https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PowerShell(或**Powershell Core**))进行各种操"
"作。"

#: src/network-proxies.md:19
msgid "\"socks5://proxy.example.com:1080\""
msgstr "\"socks5://proxy.example.com:1080\""

#: src/network-proxies.md:21
msgid ""
"Replace `socks5://proxy.example.com:1080` with `http://proxy.example."
"com:8080` when an HTTP proxy is used instead."
msgstr ""
"当使用 HTTP 代理时，将`socks5://proxy.example.com:1080`替换为`http://proxy."
"example.com:8080`。"

#: src/network-proxies.md:24
msgid ""
"If you need a more complex setup, `rustup` supports the convention used by "
"the **curl** program, documented in the ENVIRONMENT section of [its manual "
"page](https://curl.se/docs/manpage.html#:~:text=Environment,-"
"The%20environment%20variables)."
msgstr ""
"如果你需要更复杂的配置，`rustup`支持与**curl**程序所使用的约定方式相兼容的操"
"作。这些约定在[curl 的手册页》中的**环境**部分有详细说明：https://curl.se/"
"docs/manpage.html#:~:text=Environment,%20Environment%20variables。"

#: src/network-proxies.md:28
msgid ""
"The use of `curl` is presently **deprecated**, however it can still be used "
"by providing the `RUSTUP_USE_CURL` environment variable, for example:"
msgstr ""
"“curl”这个工具目前已被**弃用**，不过仍然可以通过设置`RUSTUP_USE_CURL`环境变量"
"来继续使用它，例如："

#: src/network-proxies.md:32
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#: src/network-proxies.md:35
msgid ""
"Note that some versions of `libcurl` apparently require you to drop the "
"`http://` or `https://` prefix in environment variables. For example, "
"`export http_proxy=proxy.example.com:1080` (and likewise for HTTPS). If you "
"are getting an SSL `unknown protocol` error from `rustup` via `libcurl` but "
"the command-line `curl` command works fine, this may be the problem."
msgstr ""
"请注意，某些版本的`libcurl`似乎要求在环境变量中去掉`http://`或`https://`的前"
"缀。例如，`export http_proxy=proxy.example.com:1080`（同样也需要设置 HTTPS 相"
"关参数）。如果你通过`libcurl`使用`rustup`时遇到“SSL 协议未知”的错误，而通过命"
"令行`curl`命令则没有问题，那么很可能就是这个问题导致的。"

#: src/overrides.md:1
msgid "Overrides"
msgstr "覆盖"

#: src/overrides.md:3
msgid ""
"`rustup` automatically determines which [toolchain](concepts/toolchains.md) "
"to use when one of the installed commands like `rustc` is executed. There "
"are several ways to control and override which toolchain is used:"
msgstr ""
"`rustup`在执行像`rustc`这样的已安装命令时，会自动确定使用哪个[工具链]。有几种"
"方法可以控制和覆盖所使用的工具链："

#: src/overrides.md:7
msgid ""
"A [toolchain override shorthand](#toolchain-override-shorthand) used on the "
"command-line, such as `cargo +beta`."
msgstr ""
"在命令行上使用的[工具链覆盖短语](#toolchain-override-shorthand)，例如\"cargo "
"+ beta\"。"

#: src/overrides.md:9
msgid "The `RUSTUP_TOOLCHAIN` environment variable."
msgstr "环境变量 `RUSTUP_TOOLCHAIN`。"

#: src/overrides.md:10
msgid ""
"A [directory override](#directory-overrides), set with the `rustup override` "
"command."
msgstr "一个[目录覆盖](#directory-overrides)，使用 `rusup override` 命令设置。"

#: src/overrides.md:11
msgid "The [`rust-toolchain.toml`](#the-toolchain-file) file."
msgstr " [`rust-toolchain.toml`] 文件。"

#: src/overrides.md:12
msgid "The [default toolchain](#default-toolchain)."
msgstr "默认的工具链。"

#: src/overrides.md:14
msgid ""
"The toolchain is chosen in the order listed above, using the first one that "
"is specified. There is one exception though: directory overrides and the "
"`rust-toolchain.toml` file are also preferred by their proximity to the "
"current directory. That is, these two override methods are discovered by "
"walking up the directory tree toward the filesystem root, and a `rust-"
"toolchain.toml` file that is closer to the current directory will be "
"preferred over a directory override that is further away."
msgstr ""
"工具链的选择按照上述顺序进行，首先选择第一个被指定的工具链。不过有一个例外："
"目录覆盖和`rust-toolchain.toml`文件由于更接近当前目录，因此也被优先选择。也就"
"是说，这两种覆盖方法是通过遍历目录树来发现的，而距离当前目录更近的`rust-"
"toolchain.toml`文件会被优先选择，而不是距离更远的目录覆盖方式。"

#: src/overrides.md:22
msgid "To verify which toolchain is active, you can use `rustup show`."
msgstr "为了验证哪个工具链是活跃的，你可以使用 `rustup show`。"

#: src/overrides.md:30
msgid "Toolchain override shorthand"
msgstr "工具链覆盖的简写方式"

#: src/overrides.md:32
msgid ""
"The `rustup` toolchain proxies can be instructed directly to use a specific "
"toolchain, a convenience for developers who often test different toolchains. "
"If the first argument to `cargo`, `rustc` or other tools in the toolchain "
"begins with `+`, it will be interpreted as a `rustup` toolchain name, and "
"that toolchain will be preferred, as in"
msgstr ""
"可以直接指定 `rustup` 工具链代理使用特定的工具链，这对于经常测试不同工具链的"
"开发者来说非常方便。如果 `cargo`、 `rustc` 或其他工具链中的第一个参数以 `+` "
"开头，那么它将被解释为 `rustup` 工具链的名称，并且会优先使用该工具链。"

#: src/overrides.md:42
msgid "Directory overrides"
msgstr "目录覆盖"

#: src/overrides.md:44
msgid ""
"Directories can be assigned their own Rust toolchain with `rustup override`. "
"When a directory has an override then any time `rustc` or `cargo` is run "
"inside that directory, or one of its child directories, the override "
"toolchain will be invoked."
msgstr ""
"目录可以被分配给自己的 Rust 工具链，使用 `rusup override` 。 当一个目录有覆盖"
"时，任何时候都会在该目录内运行 `rustc` 或 `cargo` 。 或者它的子目录之一将被调"
"用。"

#: src/overrides.md:49
msgid "To use to a specific nightly for a directory:"
msgstr "为某个目录使用特定的夜间版本："

#: src/overrides.md:55
msgid "Or a specific stable release:"
msgstr "或者某个特定的稳定版本："

#: src/overrides.md:61
msgid ""
"To see the active toolchain use `rustup show`. To remove the override and "
"use the default toolchain again, `rustup override unset`."
msgstr ""
"要查看正在使用的工具链，请使用 `rustup show`。若想移除覆盖设置并重新使用默认"
"工具链，请使用 `rustup override unset`。"

#: src/overrides.md:64
msgid ""
"The per-directory overrides are stored in [a configuration file]"
"(configuration.md) in `rustup`'s home directory."
msgstr ""
"每个目录的覆盖都存储在`rustup`的主目录中[一个配置文件](configuration.md)。"

#: src/overrides.md:69
msgid "The toolchain file"
msgstr "工具链文件"

#: src/overrides.md:71
msgid ""
"Some projects find themselves 'pinned' to a specific release of Rust and "
"want this information reflected in their source repository. This is most "
"often the case for nightly-only software that pins to a revision from the "
"release archives."
msgstr ""
"有些项目被“固定”在Rust的特定版本上，希望这些信息能在它们的源代码仓库中得到反"
"映。这种情况最常见的是那些仅适用于夜间版本的软件，它们会将自己绑定到发布归档"
"中的特定版本。"

#: src/overrides.md:76
msgid ""
"In these cases the toolchain can be named in the project's directory in a "
"file called `rust-toolchain.toml` or `rust-toolchain`. If both files are "
"present in a directory, the latter is used for backwards compatibility. The "
"files use the [TOML](https://toml.io/) format and have the following layout:"
msgstr ""
"在这些情况下，工具链可以在项目目录中命名为`rust-toolchain.toml`或`rust-"
"toolchain`。 如果两个文件都存在于目录中，则后者用于向后兼容性。 文件使用 "
"[TOML](https://toml.io/格式，并有以下布局："

#: src/overrides.md:83
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"[toolchain]\n"
"channel = \"nightly-2020-07-10\"\n"
"components = [ \"rustfmt\", \"rustc-dev\" ]\n"
"targets = [ \"wasm32-unknown-unknown\", \"thumbv2-none-eabi\" ]\n"
"profile = \"minimal\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```toml\n"
"[toolchain]\n"
"channel = \"nightly-2020-07-10\"\n"
"components = [ \"rustfmt\", \"rustc-dev\" ]\n"
"targets = [ \"wasm32-unknown-unknown\", \"thumbv2-none-eabi\" ]\n"
"profile = \"minimal\"\n"
"```"

#: src/overrides.md:91
msgid ""
"The `[toolchain]` section is mandatory, and at least one property must be "
"specified. `channel` and `path` are mutually exclusive."
msgstr ""
"`[toolchain]`»这一部分是必填项，至少需要指定一个属性。«`channel`»和«`path`»是"
"互斥的。"

#: src/overrides.md:94
msgid ""
"For backwards compatibility, `rust-toolchain` files also support a legacy "
"format that only contains a toolchain name without any TOML encoding, e.g. "
"just `nightly-2021-01-21`. The file has to be encoded in US-ASCII in this "
"case (if you are on Windows, check the encoding and that it does not start "
"with a BOM). The legacy format is not available in `rust-toolchain.toml` "
"files."
msgstr ""
"为了向后兼容， `rust-toolchain` 文件还支持一种旧格式，该格式仅包含工具链名"
"称，且未使用 TOML 编码，例如仅为 `nightly-2021-01-21`。在这种情况下，文件必须"
"使用 US-ASCII 编码（如果您在 Windows 系统上，请检查编码并确保其不以 BOM 开"
"头）。 `rust-toolchain.toml` 文件不支持这种旧格式。"

#: src/overrides.md:100
msgid ""
"If you see the following error (when running `rustc`, `cargo` or other "
"command)"
msgstr ""
"如果您在运行 `rustc`、 `cargo` 或其他命令时看到以下错误，请按如下方式处理："

#: src/overrides.md:106
msgid ""
"it means you're running `rustup` pre-1.23.0 and trying to interact with a "
"project that uses the new TOML encoding in the `rust-toolchain` file. You "
"need to upgrade `rustup` to 1.23.0+."
msgstr ""
"这意味着您正在运行 `rustup` 版本，且低于 1.23.0 版本，同时试图与一个在 `rust-"
"toolchain` 版本中使用新 TOML 编码格式的项目进行交互。您需要将`rustup` 版本升"
"级到 1.23.0 及以上版本。"

#: src/overrides.md:110
msgid ""
"The `rust-toolchain.toml`/`rust-toolchain` files are suitable to check in to "
"source control. If that's done, `Cargo.lock` should probably be tracked too "
"if the toolchain is pinned to a specific release, to avoid potential "
"compatibility issues with dependencies."
msgstr ""
"这些 `rust-toolchain.toml`/`rust-toolchain` 文件适合提交到源代码控制。如果已"
"经完成了这一步，那么如果工具链被固定在一个特定的版本上，也应该对 `Cargo."
"lock` 进行跟踪，以避免与依赖项出现兼容性问题。"

#: src/overrides.md:115
msgid "Toolchain file settings"
msgstr "工具链文件设置"

#: src/overrides.md:117
msgid "channel"
msgstr "频道"

#: src/overrides.md:119
msgid ""
"The `channel` setting specifies which [toolchain](concepts/toolchains.md) to "
"use. The value is a string in the following form:"
msgstr ""
"“通道”设置指定了要使用的 [toolchain](concepts/toolchains.md)。该值是一个字符"
"串，其形式如下："

#: src/overrides.md:133
msgid "path"
msgstr "路径"

#: src/overrides.md:135
msgid ""
"The `path` setting allows a custom toolchain to be used. The value is an "
"absolute path string."
msgstr "设置 `path` 允许使用自定义的工具链。该值是一个绝对路径字符串。"

#: src/overrides.md:138
msgid ""
"Since a `path` directive directly names a local toolchain, other options "
"like `components`, `targets`, and `profile` have no effect."
msgstr ""
"由于 `path` 指令直接指定了一个本地工具链，因此其他选项，比如 `components`、 "
"`targets` 和 `profile` 则没有任何效果。"

#: src/overrides.md:141
msgid ""
"`channel` and `path` are mutually exclusive, since a `path` already points "
"to a specific toolchain."
msgstr "`channel` 和 `path` 是互斥的，因为 `path` 已经指向了特定的工具链。"

#: src/overrides.md:144
msgid "profile"
msgstr "个人资料"

#: src/overrides.md:146
msgid ""
"The `profile` setting names a group of components to be installed. The value "
"is a string. The valid options are: `minimal`, `default`, and `complete`. "
"See [profiles](concepts/profiles.md) for details of each."
msgstr ""
"\"配置文件\"设置要安装的组件组。值是一个字符串。 有效的选项是：`最小化`, "
"`default`, 和 `complete`。每个选项的详细信息见 [profiles](concepts/profiles."
"md)。"

#: src/overrides.md:150
msgid ""
"Note that if not specified, the `default` profile is not necessarily used, "
"as a different default profile might have been set with `rustup set profile`."
msgstr ""
"请注意，如果没有指定，则不一定会使用 `default` 配置，因为可能已设置了不同的默"
"认配置，即 `rustup set profile`。"

#: src/overrides.md:156
msgid "components"
msgstr "组件"

#: src/overrides.md:158
msgid ""
"The `components` setting contains a list of additional components to "
"install. The value is a list of strings. See [components](concepts/"
"components.md) for a list of components. Note that different toolchains may "
"have different components available."
msgstr ""
"`components`设置中包含需要安装的额外组件列表。该值是一个字符串列表。有关组件"
"的列表，请参见[components](concepts/components.md)部分。请注意，不同的工具链"
"可能提供不同的组件。"

#: src/overrides.md:163
msgid "The components listed here are additive with the current profile."
msgstr "这里列出的组件会与当前配置一起被添加。"

#: src/overrides.md:167
msgid "targets"
msgstr "目标"

#: src/overrides.md:169
msgid ""
"The `targets` setting contains a list of platforms to install for [cross-"
"compilation](https://rust-lang.github.io/rustup/cross-compilation.html). The "
"value is a list of strings."
msgstr ""
"`targets`设置包含要为 [cross-compilation](https://rust-lang.github.io/rustup/"
"cross-compilation.html)安装的平台列表。该值是字符串列表。"

#: src/overrides.md:172
msgid ""
"The host platform is automatically included; the targets listed here are "
"additive."
msgstr "主机平台会自动被包含进来；这里列出的目标都是可选的。"

#: src/overrides.md:177
msgid "Default toolchain"
msgstr "默认工具链"

#: src/overrides.md:179
msgid ""
"If no other overrides are set, the global default toolchain will be used. "
"This default can be chosen when `rustup` is [installed](installation/index."
"md). The `rustup default` command can be used to set and query the current "
"default. Run `rustup default` without any arguments to print the current "
"default. Specify a toolchain as an argument to change the default:"
msgstr ""
"如果没有其他覆盖设置，将使用全局默认的工具链。这种默认设置可以在安装 "
"`rustup` 时选择。可以使用 `rustup default` 命令来设置和查询当前的默认设置。无"
"需任何参数地运行 `rustup default` 即可打印当前的默认设置。可以通过指定工具链"
"作为参数来更改默认设置。"

#: src/security.md:1
msgid "Security"
msgstr "安全性"

#: src/security.md:3
msgid ""
"`rustup` is secure enough for most people, but it [still needs work](https://"
"github.com/rust-lang/rustup/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3Asecurity). "
"`rustup` performs all downloads over HTTPS, but does not yet validate "
"signatures of downloads."
msgstr ""
"`rustup` 对于大多数人来说是足够安全的，但它[仍然需要工作](https://github.com/"
"rust-lang/rustup/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3Asecurity)。 `rustup`通"
"过HTTPS进行所有下载，但尚未验证下载签名。"

#: src/security.md:9
msgid ""
"File modes on installation honor umask as of 1.18.4, use umask if very tight "
"controls are desired."
msgstr ""
"从1.18.4版本开始，安装过程中的文件模式会遵循umask的设置。如果确实需要严格控制"
"权限，建议使用umask。"

#: src/security.md:12
msgid ""
"If you wish to report a security issue, please follow the [Rust security "
"policy](https://www.rust-lang.org/policies/security)."
msgstr ""
"如果您想报告一个安全问题，请遵循[Rust 安全政策](https://www.rust-lang.org/"
"policies/security)。"

#: src/SUMMARY.md:1
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "摘要"
